<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche forecasts higher 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Roche forecasts higher 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss pharmaceuticals group Roche Holding AG said it expected further positive sales growth through the fourth quarter this year and another rise in full-year net profit.</p>
<p>&quot;Barring extraordinary events, consolidated net income can be expected to rise once again for the year as a whole,&quot; Roche said in its nine-month sales report.  </p>
<p>Roche reported a 10 percent rise in sales on a comparable basis for the first nine months of 1996 to 11.729 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>Roche had a 1995 group net profit of 3.37 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
